{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/430975-do-demons-have-an-aura-effect","id":430975,"title":"Do Demons have an aura effect?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-06T21:06:15-08:00","id":430975,"title":"Do Demons have an aura effect?","content":"I'm trying to get a handle on the core, cross-line mechanics of 2e, and one thing i'm not totally clear on is &quot;auras&quot; like Vampire's predatory aura and (apparently) Mage's nimbus. As I understand it, this is like a unified thing where &quot;when supernaturals encounter each other, their auras (whatever they may be) interact&quot;. Is Spoofing supposed to fill that rules niche for demons where it's the thing that activates when a vampire flashes their predatory aura at them? Or something else, or is there no equivalent? If someone can walk me through how the &quot;aura&quot; works as a generic concept and whether demons have one, or point me to an open development blog post about it or something, I would really appreciate it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T21:14:59-08:00","id":431012,"title":"","content":"Not everyone has an aura, and &quot;auras&quot; aren't really one thing. Vampires and werewolves, both being predatory monsters, overlap a little bit, but there isn't a general rule that if you're a monster, you project a signal on a common wavelength. Demons don't have any equivalent, 'cause it'd kinda be suicide.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T21:22:42-08:00","id":431031,"title":"","content":"Ah, okay- I was under the impression it was one thing from the way I heard auras being described. Thanks!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T21:24:03-08:00","id":431033,"title":"","content":"Yeah, out of all the types of Supernaturals, Demons seem like the one that <i>definitely </i>wouldn't have one. Or if you had to, you might look at Spoofing as being their &quot;aura&quot; if you think of that aura as an aura of totally normal human normalness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T22:03:51-08:00","id":431051,"title":"","content":"The nearest thing to an &quot;aura&quot; that the Unchained have in the existing mechanics as a universal ability is using Primum as a Supernatural Tolerance Trait while in Cover, which, as noted, is basically the opposite of a good idea unless you're wearing a burner Cover and don't care to risk the full consequences of going loud.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T10:12:40-08:00","id":431392,"title":"","content":"Has anyone run an equivalent to Predator's Aura, Aspect, and Nimbus? The whole &quot;afflict someone with a Condition&quot; bit? I've been considering one for Demon using key Demon Form parts....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T17:18:52-08:00","id":432019,"title":"","content":"Terror and Glory form power?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thread Reaper <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">\uff1c(\u00b4 \u055e)\u0a0a( \u055e )\uff1e\ufeff</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/377-xanandithras","name":"Xanandithras","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar377_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"427"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T18:11:03-08:00","id":432083,"title":"","content":"Having &quot;auras&quot; is kind counter to the whole parallel of Demon being spies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4055-felipe","name":"Felipe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4055_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"538"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T06:54:50-07:00","id":432587,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xanandithras</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/430975-do-demons-have-an-aura-effect?p=432019#post432019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Terror and Glory form power?</div> </div> </div> </div> That's one of them I was considering, along with Corruption Aura. Maybe a few home brew ones. Just wondering if someone else had an experience.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Felipe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/430975-do-demons-have-an-aura-effect?p=432083#post432083\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Having &quot;auras&quot; is kind counter to the whole parallel of Demon being spies.</div> </div> </div> </div> First, I'm not talking about an aura. That's kinda a recognition thing. I'm talking about using some part of your demonic being to affect others mentally / physically with your powers, like WtF Aspects. Its no different than Going Loud, or assuming Demon Form at all. Or using an Exploit. Or...<br /> <br /> You get the idea. Deliberately breaking Cover happens with demons fairly often in deliberate measures.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-15T18:42:04-07:00","id":443514,"title":"","content":"You might houserule that Going Loud puts the Need New Underwear Tilt on mortal bystanders.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}